   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Social work Archangelsk</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Socialt arbete Archangels</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project comprises training for supervisors in a programme for practical social work. Sida has been financing this programme since the mid 90-ies in cooperation with the faculty for Social Work at the Medical Academy in Archangelsk. The project period is 2 years.Swedish counterpart is Strong Development and the University of Ume&#xE5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildning av socialarbetare i Archangelskomr&#xE5;det. 20 socialarbetare kommer att under en tv&#xE5;&#xE5;rsperiod erbjudas delta i fyra veckol&#xE5;nga seminarier per &#xE5;r. Insatsen sker i samarbete med institutionen f&#xF6;r socialt arbete vid Medicinska Akademin i Archangelsk. Svenska samarbetsparter &#xE4;r Strong Development och Ume&#xE5; Universitet.</narrative>
  </description>
